## Your Tools
These are the tools available to YOU. When native tool execution is enabled, prefer the registered native tools and pass the arguments below directly as input. JSON `calls` is a compatibility alternative: use the same tool name in `tool_name` and the same arguments in `args`. These are two invocation formats for the same tools, not separate tool catalogs. The JSON examples below illustrate the compatibility format; they do not imply that native tools are unavailable. Use one execution channel per response and never submit the same call through both.
